DAY 1 of the @popflex_active team retreat!!

The goal was to pamper and spoil the @popflex_active team with a week full of unique experiences - things normally a brand would only do for an influencer trip. I don’t have all the money in the world to do that but I do choose to spend my money on the people I’m on this special journey with. The people making this company and this brand exactly what it is today. 

Big thank you to the most amazing retreat planner @jackelynho (who also happens to be my little sister) who basically said “trust me” and blew past my already unrealistically high expectations.

Literally had to take over an hour of footage down to just a few minutes for a day 1 recap because of all the special little details Jackelyn surprised us with! This is part 1 of a 3 part series…I CANNOT wait to show you the rest.

